WEBVTT

00:23:55.704 --> 00:24:00.538
I vividly remember one of them saying,
you're turning us into robots.

00:24:01.121 --> 00:24:03.621
Danny decided to test which
approach worked best.

00:24:04.079 --> 00:24:06.538
Was that their intuition or their
ratings from the data?

00:24:07.246 --> 00:24:11.454
The answer was both their ratings
plus their intuition,

00:24:12.079 --> 00:24:15.746
but not their intuition at the beginning,
their intuition at the end,

00:24:16.038 --> 00:24:17.329
after they did the ratings,

00:24:18.121 --> 00:24:27.913
that is, you read those six straight and
then close your eyes and just have

00:24:27.954 --> 00:24:31.496
an intuition how good you think
the soldier is going to be.